./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:34:- Update `backend/src/server.ts` to remove the `projectsRouter` import and `/api/projects` mount. If the backend only has health after this deletion and is not used by any runtime, consider deleting the entire backend workspace in this same implementation rather than preserving a server shell.
