./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:116:- Backend API integration tests for `POST`, `GET`, `PUT/PATCH`, list, and delete project endpoints using the shared contract only; tests must prove no stale `ProjectDTO` fields such as `elements2D`, `elements3D`, `dependencyGraph`, `planes`, `hingeLines`, `view2D`, `processTree`, or `commandHistory` survive as accepted backend contract fields.
