./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:26:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:5:Adopt one explicit backend stance by removing the unused backend project API from the active architecture. The current active project persistence is frontend command-stream `ProjectData` routed through the Wave 009 app-shell runtime and Google Drive ports. The backend stores a stale `ProjectDTO` shape with broad `any` fields and is skipped by root validation. The direct fix is to delete the disconnected backend project API/storage/tests and delete the dead `OpenProjectDialog.vue` component that imports backend source.
