./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:68:architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:86:**Evidence:** Operation parameters, outputs, and serialized-operation data are `Record<string, any>` / free-form fields (`frontend/src/commands/operations/IOperation.ts:118`, `frontend/src/commands/operations/IOperation.ts:128`, `frontend/src/commands/operations/IOperation.ts:134`, `frontend/src/commands/operations/IOperation.ts:136`, `frontend/src/commands/operations/IOperation.ts:160`). Projection-plane realizations use `world: any` (`frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1428`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1436`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1689`, `frontend/src/domain/world/ProjectionPlane.ts:1747`). Backend `ProjectDTO` uses `Array<any>` and `root: any` (`backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:14`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:42`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:69:architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:122:**Evidence:** Root package declares `backend` as a workspace (`package.json:7`, `package.json:8`) but root `build`, `test`, and `lint` delegate only to frontend (`package.json:11`, `package.json:12`, `package.json:14`). Backend has separate build/test scripts (`backend/package.json:7`, `backend/package.json:8`, `backend/package.json:10`). Backend project routes and DTOs are independent of frontend `ProjectService` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:5`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`; `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:70`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:70:architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:177:**Evidence:** `OpenProjectDialog.vue` imports `ProjectMetadata` from backend source (`frontend/src/components/dialogs/OpenProjectDialog.vue:57`). Frontend persistence uses `ProjectService` command serialization and Drive/local flows (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:301`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:247`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:405`), while backend routes/DTOs are separate (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`).
