./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:97:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:8:specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md:672:**Outputs**: `backend/src/api/projects.ts`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts`  
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:98:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:10:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:21:- **The backend is not an adapter for that boundary.** It exposes `/api/projects` over a separate `ProjectDTO` shape (`backend/src/models/Project.ts:6-52`) and unvalidated file repository (`backend/src/storage/ProjectRepository.ts:27-95`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:99:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:12:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:43:This would satisfy Wave 010 only if the backend becomes a real active boundary. It is not recommended for this wave because current app behavior is Drive-based, no frontend source fetches `/api/projects`, and adding a second storage adapter now would broaden scope toward product feature work rather than architectural deletion.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:100:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:14:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:55:- Delete `backend/src/api/projects.ts`.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:101:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:16:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:60:- Remove `/api/projects` from `backend/src/server.ts`, or delete the backend workspace if no active backend capability remains.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:102:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:18:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:77:- `specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md` `/api/projects` backend storage snippets.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:103:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:19:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:78:- `specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md` output references to `backend/src/api/projects.ts`.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:104:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:22:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:91:- The stale backend `/api/projects` feature disappears. This is intentional architectural behavior change: project persistence has one active boundary.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:105:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:23:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:102:  - no `/api/projects` in retained source/tests/current docs except historical notes intentionally deleted or marked obsolete.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:106:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:24:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-restructure.md:147:- **Risk: backend deletion is too aggressive if hidden external clients use `/api/projects`.** Project objectives explicitly assign zero weight to backward compatibility and on-disk/source tree is the sole authority; no current frontend usage was found.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:107:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:29:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:28:- Delete `backend/src/api/projects.ts`.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:108:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:31:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:33:- Update `backend/src/server.ts` to remove the `projectsRouter` import and `/api/projects` mount. If the backend only has health after this deletion and is not used by any runtime, consider deleting the entire backend workspace in this same implementation rather than preserving a server shell.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:109:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:34:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:53:- `specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/research.md` references to `/api/projects` and backend file storage.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:110:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:35:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:54:- `specs/001-dihedral-learning-mvp/plan.md` references to `backend/src/api/projects.ts` output.
