./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:112:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:39:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:66:- `/api/projects` import/mount from `backend/src/server.ts`.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:113:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:40:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:73:- Backend `/api/projects` HTTP endpoints will be removed. This is intentional because they are disconnected from active frontend persistence and encode a stale DTO.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:114:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:41:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/proposals/proposal-direct.md:81:- Static scan: no `/api/projects` route references remain in active source, tests, docs retained as current guidance.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:115:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:49:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/scope-check.md:35:`backend/src/server.ts` mounts `projectsRouter` at `/api/projects` (`backend/src/server.ts:1-15`). `backend/src/api/projects.ts` exposes list/create/get/update/delete route handlers (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:11-110`) backed by `ProjectRepository` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:1-5`). Update accepts the request body as `updates` with no DTO validation beyond existence (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:65-77`). Error handlers use `error: any` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:15-18`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:35-38`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:55-58`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:78-84`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:103-108`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:116:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:50:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/scope-check.md:43:`backend/tests/integration/projects.spec.ts` tests `/api/projects` creation, loading, update, list, sort, and delete behavior (`backend/tests/integration/projects.spec.ts:39-342`). The tests assert backend DTO defaults such as `planes`, `hingeLines`, `elements2D`, `elements3D`, `dependencyGraph`, `processTree`, and `view2D` (`backend/tests/integration/projects.spec.ts:51-81`, `backend/tests/integration/projects.spec.ts:135-154`, `backend/tests/integration/projects.spec.ts:171-215`). They do not exercise frontend `ProjectService` command streams or the app-shell Drive flow.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:117:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:54:architecture-audit/wave-plan.md:442:- `backend/src/api/projects.ts`
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:118:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:60:architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:15:The backend entry point is `backend/src/server.ts`, which creates the Express app and port, installs CORS and JSON middleware, mounts `/health` and `/api/projects`, and starts listening (`backend/src/server.ts:6`, `backend/src/server.ts:7`, `backend/src/server.ts:10`, `backend/src/server.ts:11`, `backend/src/server.ts:14`, `backend/src/server.ts:15`, `backend/src/server.ts:18`). Its project routes use a file-backed repository directly inside the router module (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:1`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:2`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:5`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:119:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:61:architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:55:The backend is a thin Express/file-storage stack. Routes directly instantiate `ProjectRepository` with `process.cwd()/data/projects` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:5`) and call repository methods in each route handler (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:25`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:45`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:65`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:91`). `ProjectDTO` is a broad DTO with `Array<any>` for frontend element snapshots, `root: any` for process tree, and `Array<any>` operations (`backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:14`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:42`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`). Backend persistence is therefore separate from the command-sourced frontend `ProjectService` rather than a shared contract layer.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:120:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:63:architecture-audit/baseline/architecture-map.md:92:Despite that type-only import, the active frontend persistence path is local/Drive-oriented: `App.vue` creates `ProjectService`/Drive flows, while `ProjectService` serializes command history and replays commands (`frontend/src/App.vue:160`, `frontend/src/App.vue:375`, `frontend/src/App.vue:416`, `frontend/src/App.vue:431`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:301`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:247`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:405`). The backend exposes Express project routes and a broad `ProjectDTO` (`backend/src/server.ts:14`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`), but the baseline found no normal frontend HTTP-client path using those project routes. The backend is therefore a parallel/disconnected persistence surface in the current architecture.
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:121:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:65:architecture-audit/baseline/inventory.md:58:HTTP API route handlers. `projects.ts` defines list/create/read/update/delete routes around `ProjectRepository` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:5`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:25`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:45`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:65`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:91`); `health.ts` defines the health router (`backend/src/api/health.ts:3`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:122:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:69:architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:122:**Evidence:** Root package declares `backend` as a workspace (`package.json:7`, `package.json:8`) but root `build`, `test`, and `lint` delegate only to frontend (`package.json:11`, `package.json:12`, `package.json:14`). Backend has separate build/test scripts (`backend/package.json:7`, `backend/package.json:8`, `backend/package.json:10`). Backend project routes and DTOs are independent of frontend `ProjectService` (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:5`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`; `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:70`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:123:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:70:architecture-audit/baseline/risk-register.md:177:**Evidence:** `OpenProjectDialog.vue` imports `ProjectMetadata` from backend source (`frontend/src/components/dialogs/OpenProjectDialog.vue:57`). Frontend persistence uses `ProjectService` command serialization and Drive/local flows (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`, `frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:301`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:247`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:405`), while backend routes/DTOs are separate (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/api/projects.ts:11`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:13`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:50`).
./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-round-02-grep.stdout.log:124:architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/validation/review-rg.stdout.log:71:architecture-audit/baseline/corrections-round-01.md:13:| Reviewer-A C4; Reviewer-B C5 — frontend-backend import and backend disconnected status | Addressed | `architecture-map.md`, `quality-report.md`, `risk-register.md` | Added direct frontend import of backend model type (`frontend/src/components/dialogs/OpenProjectDialog.vue:57`) and documented that active frontend persistence uses ProjectService/local/Drive flows (`frontend/src/services/ProjectService.ts:261`, `frontend/src/services/GoogleDriveService.ts:247`) while backend project routes/DTOs are a parallel path (`backend/src/api/projects.ts:4`, `backend/src/models/Project.ts:6`). |
