./architecture-audit/cycle-010-backend-frontend-project-contract/decision.md:61:- If `frontend/tests/e2e/persistence.spec.ts` exists in the implementation tree, delete it or replace it with active app-shell/startup/open-project/project-persistence coverage that does not call `localhost:3000/api/projects`. Round 02 notes this file appears absent already, so the implementation should not claim a fresh deletion if it is still absent; it must ensure the stale path is not reintroduced.
